ine/godot/pull/118789.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-24T19:51:14Z"},"body":"This implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13386 For `AnimationNodeOneShot`, `AnimationNodeTransition`, `AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D`, and `AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D`.\r\n\r\nThe new parameter matches how it looks in the proposed mockup:\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"382\" height=\"230\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-20 at 11 28 07 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58e09b95-98b5-43d8-9c22-c16df4a9caeb\" />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\nAnd here's how it appears in the tree itself:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"515\" height=\"331\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-20 at 11 27 11 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7439f7a4-5692-449d-ae27-889b43807a29\" />\r\n<br />\r\n\r\nI think this is OK although the view within the AnimationTree tab is a bit confusing without labels or tooltips.\r\n\r\nUsage is to manually set the observer in the animation tree's parameter list and then in code like:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar observer := tree.get(observer_path) as AnimationNodeObserverOneShot\r\nif observer:\r\n    observer.started.connect(callback)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe following test project has scenes testing each of the new observer types. Arrow keys to drive the animation node(s) and escape to return to the main menu.\r\n\r\n\r\n[animation_tree_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27068062/animation_tree_test.zip)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118789/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118789/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}